{"fr": "<form class=\"nl\" name=\"bons-plans\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify-honeypot=\"site-web\" novalidate>\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"bons-plans\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"langue\" value=\"fr\">\n  <p class=\"hp\" hidden><label>Ne pas remplir <input name=\"site-web\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></p>\n  <h2>Recevez les bons plans</h2><p class=\"small nl-lead\">Une sélection des meilleurs prix, une à deux fois par mois, par e-mail ou sur WhatsApp. Gratuit, désinscription à tout moment.</p>\n  <div class=\"nl-row\"><label><span>E-mail</span><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label>\n  <label><span>WhatsApp (facultatif)</span><input type=\"tel\" name=\"whatsapp\" autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+33 6 12 34 56 78\"></label></div>\n  <label class=\"nl-consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" value=\"oui\"> <span>J’accepte de recevoir les bons plans d’Escale. Mes coordonnées servent uniquement à cela ; je peux me désinscrire à tout moment.</span></label>\n  <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Je m’inscris</button><p class=\"small nl-msg\" role=\"status\"></p>\n</form>", "en": "<form class=\"nl\" name=\"bons-plans\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify-honeypot=\"site-web\" novalidate>\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"bons-plans\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"langue\" value=\"en\">\n  <p class=\"hp\" hidden><label>Ne pas remplir <input name=\"site-web\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></p>\n  <h2>Get the deals</h2><p class=\"small nl-lead\">A selection of the best prices, once or twice a month, by email or on WhatsApp. Free, unsubscribe anytime.</p>\n  <div class=\"nl-row\"><label><span>Email</span><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label>\n  <label><span>WhatsApp (optional)</span><input type=\"tel\" name=\"whatsapp\" autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+33 6 12 34 56 78\"></label></div>\n  <label class=\"nl-consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" value=\"oui\"> <span>I agree to receive Escale deals. My details are used only for this; I can unsubscribe at any time.</span></label>\n  <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Sign me up</button><p class=\"small nl-msg\" role=\"status\"></p>\n</form>", "es": "<form class=\"nl\" name=\"bons-plans\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify-honeypot=\"site-web\" novalidate>\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"bons-plans\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"langue\" value=\"es\">\n  <p class=\"hp\" hidden><label>Ne pas remplir <input name=\"site-web\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></p>\n  <h2>Recibe las ofertas</h2><p class=\"small nl-lead\">Una selección de los mejores precios, una o dos veces al mes, por correo o por WhatsApp. Gratis, baja cuando quieras.</p>\n  <div class=\"nl-row\"><label><span>Correo</span><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label>\n  <label><span>WhatsApp (opcional)</span><input type=\"tel\" name=\"whatsapp\" autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+33 6 12 34 56 78\"></label></div>\n  <label class=\"nl-consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" value=\"oui\"> <span>Acepto recibir las ofertas de Escale. Mis datos solo se usan para esto; puedo darme de baja en cualquier momento.</span></label>\n  <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Suscribirme</button><p class=\"small nl-msg\" role=\"status\"></p>\n</form>", "pt": "<form class=\"nl\" name=\"bons-plans\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify-honeypot=\"site-web\" novalidate>\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"bons-plans\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"langue\" value=\"pt\">\n  <p class=\"hp\" hidden><label>Ne pas remplir <input name=\"site-web\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></p>\n  <h2>Receba as promoções</h2><p class=\"small nl-lead\">Uma seleção dos melhores preços, uma ou duas vezes por mês, por e-mail ou WhatsApp. Grátis, cancele quando quiser.</p>\n  <div class=\"nl-row\"><label><span>E-mail</span><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label>\n  <label><span>WhatsApp (opcional)</span><input type=\"tel\" name=\"whatsapp\" autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+33 6 12 34 56 78\"></label></div>\n  <label class=\"nl-consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" value=\"oui\"> <span>Aceito receber as promoções da Escale. Os meus dados só servem para isso; posso cancelar a qualquer momento.</span></label>\n  <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Inscrever-me</button><p class=\"small nl-msg\" role=\"status\"></p>\n</form>", "ar": "<form class=\"nl\" name=\"bons-plans\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify-honeypot=\"site-web\" novalidate>\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"bons-plans\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"langue\" value=\"ar\">\n  <p class=\"hp\" hidden><label>Ne pas remplir <input name=\"site-web\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></p>\n  <h2>احصل على العروض</h2><p class=\"small nl-lead\">مختارات من أفضل الأسعار، مرة أو مرتين في الشهر، عبر البريد أو واتساب. مجانًا، ويمكنك الإلغاء في أي وقت.</p>\n  <div class=\"nl-row\"><label><span>البريد الإلكتروني</span><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label>\n  <label><span>واتساب (اختياري)</span><input type=\"tel\" name=\"whatsapp\" autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+33 6 12 34 56 78\"></label></div>\n  <label class=\"nl-consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" value=\"oui\"> <span>أوافق على تلقي عروض Escale. تُستخدم بياناتي لهذا فقط، ويمكنني الإلغاء في أي وقت.</span></label>\n  <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">اشترك</button><p class=\"small nl-msg\" role=\"status\"></p>\n</form>"}